{% comment %}
  BetterBrand — smoker-labor-day-lander. Shopify SECTION.

  Add as sections/smoker-labor-day-lander.liquid, then reference it from a page template
  so it renders inside the theme layout. That is what lets Intelligems, the
  store's Meta pixel and Northbeam all see the page.

  CSS IS SCOPED. Everything is namespaced under .bb-smoker-labor-day. Bare element resets
  are emitted as :where(.bb-smoker-labor-day) el so they contribute ZERO specificity and
  cannot outrank this section's own classes, and the design tokens live on the
  wrapper rather than :root. Do not "tidy" either of those: they are what stops
  this section restyling the theme header, logo and fonts.

  Images and fonts load from https://bb-cough-gummies.pages.dev, so nothing needs uploading to assets.

  Our own Meta and Northbeam snippets were REMOVED for the theme build. The
  store already runs both plus Intelligems, so keeping ours would double count.
{% endcomment %}

