    <h1>You Are Not Ready To Quit Smoking. Nobody Makes A Lung Product For You.</h1>

    <figure id="hero">
      <img src="https://bb-cough-gummies.pages.dev/assets/hero-smoker.jpg" alt="A man in his early sixties sitting on his back step at dawn with a coffee mug, an ashtray on the step beside him" width="1000" height="1333" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
