    <p class="byline">Reviewed by Chris Jackson, PharmD, formulator at Betterbrand &nbsp;|&nbsp; Updated August 2026</p>

    <p>Every product in this aisle assumes you are quitting on Monday. The patches, the apps, the pamphlet the doctor gave you.</p>

    <p><b>So a pharmacist made this one instead.</b></p>

    <h2>Two Lung-Shaped Gummies A Day. That Is The Whole Ask.</h2>

    <figure>
      <img src="https://bb-cough-gummies.pages.dev/assets/gummy-macro.jpg" alt="Two lung-shaped amber mullein gummies on a wooden cutting board in morning light" width="1200" height="896" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </figure>

    <p>Lung shaped, deep amber, pear flavored. Two chews with your coffee and you are done for the day.</p>

    <p>Each serving carries <b>2,000mg of mullein equivalent</b>, drawn from 40mg of a <b>50:1 concentrated extract</b>. Concentrating the leaf is the only reason a full dose fits into two chews instead of a mug you have to brew.</p>

    <figure>
      <img src="https://bb-cough-gummies.pages.dev/assets/bag-counter.jpg" alt="A bag of BetterLungs Mullein Gummies on a clean kitchen counter beside a mug, car keys and reading glasses" width="1200" height="896" loading="lazy">
    </figure>

    <p>Sixty to a bag, so one bag is one month. No quit date, no counselor, no app, no contract.</p>

